dist/

# Comet change runtime state. Durable artifacts stay tracked: the change's .comet.yaml and
# .openspec.yaml, .comet/handoff/, and .comet/subagent-progress.md.
openspec/changes/*/.comet/*
!openspec/changes/*/.comet/handoff/
!openspec/changes/*/.comet/subagent-progress.md
openspec/changes/archive/*/.comet/*
!openspec/changes/archive/*/.comet/handoff/
!openspec/changes/archive/*/.comet/subagent-progress.md
